# Harvested node receipts are permanent campaign evidence, not runtime noise.
# Exempt them from the global *.log rule above — without this, ~44% of a harvest
# (build logs, cert runs, server logs) is silently dropped at commit time.
!data/receipts/**

# --- private working material: kept on disk, never published (2026-08-07 scan) ---
# Verbatim agent-session transcripts. Used as a text corpus for PPL/KLD measurement;
# the receipts cite it as a private corpus rather than shipping it.
data/receipts/p100-lab-harvest/quant_ladder/own_notes_corpus.txt
# Verbatim messages written to models — private working notes.
data/Apollo Docs/july7_26_*
# Unposted drafts. Publishing them here would pre-empt posting them properly.
data/Apollo Docs/*_DRAFT.md
# Content notes quoting third-party Discord conversations.
data/receipts/**/CONTENT_NOTES_*.md
